{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042254-\u200b-2e-your-nameless-orders","id":1042254,"title":"\u200b[2E] Your Nameless Orders","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-01T23:51:20-08:00","id":1042254,"title":"\u200b[2E] Your Nameless Orders","content":"Topic for posting your ideas on Nameless Orders to use in Mage games. We know they follow <i>Mystery Cult Initiation</i> Merit, so let\u2019s generally stick with this. For ease of talk I will quote dots spread of MCI Merit.<br /> <br /> \u2022 A Skill Specialty or one-dot Merit pertaining to the lessons taught to initiates.<br /> \u2022\u2022 A one-dot Merit<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 A Skill dot or a two-dot Merit<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 A three-dot Merit<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 A three-dot Merit or a major advantage not reflected in game traits<br /> <br /> And here are two proposed by me \u2013 with second one, some help would be appreciated. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Nameless Order - Lovers of Devil</span></b><br /> For almost millennium, Church has accused many women and man of contacts with Devil and getting sorcery powers from this. Many Awakened were misunderstood because of it \u2013 to Christians what was Supernal has become Hell, spells became curses and High Speech of Atlantis was Devil\u2019s Tongue. Lovers of Devil are Nameless that embraced those accusations and worship Dark One as their patron. More, they really can summon things that anyone could only describe as demons from Hell.<br /> Awakened from Pentacle or Seers alike agree that Lovers have made in compact with some being from Lower Depths that want to spread sin and wickedness. Mysterium scholars call this dimension as Inferno, but any other can simply call it Hell. As now labeled as Left Hand practice, it lived for almost one thousand years on outskirts of Awakened communities. Most of new members were coming from Nameless that were left on their own \u2013 when they uncovered cursed Grimoire or relict of previous sabbath, Lovers come in compact with lower demons from this realm and form covens around it. Their patrons give them clues and advices to find other of their kind, forming loose alliance over whole countries or continents.<br /> <br /> <b>Order Tools:</b> Blood, sacrifice, orgies.<br /> <br /> <b>Initiation</b><br /> 1: Patron \u2013 Novice in coven need to make Pact with Patron of it, being able to communicate with Inferno demon by rituals.<br /> 2: High Speech ( as Devils Tongue )<br /> 3: Vice-Ridden ( CoD Rulebook )<br /> 4: Library (Occult) 3<br /> 5: Summoning \u2013 Highest witch in sabbath can summon it\u2019s Patron as instant action by connection it have with it.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Nameless Order - Dreamspeakers</span></b><br /> Dreamspeakers Legacy is said to hail from various shamanistic traditions, connecting holy men with so called Dreamborns in Anima Mundi \u2013 gods of Dreamtime. This Nameless Order is template for those aboriginal cults that you still can found in heart of Africa, Australia, Oceania, North and South America. From Age of Exploration, Mysterium were doing extensive research on them, seeing some universal patterns in those primal communities, but most of them over throw people that were studying them and their \u2018white magic\u2019. When come Nameless War and many of those indigenous communities were endangered, future Dreamspeakers joined Nameless and later Free Council as Libertines. Still, there are enclosed communities in world that did not welcome both Diamond or Free Council and they stick to their own belief in Dreamborns.<br /> <br /> <b>Order Tools:</b> Admission of entheogen, Ritual dancing, ???<br /> <br /> <b>Initiation</b><br /> 1: High Speech Merit ( as Dreamborn Tales or incantations )<br /> 2: ???<br /> 3: ???<br /> 4: Astral Adept<br /> 5: Summoning \u2013 Highest shamans can summon their Dreamborn patron as instant action by connection it have with it. As powerful goetia, Dreamborns do not have Manifestations, so they linger in Twilight near shaman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-01T23:58:12-08:00","id":1042256,"title":"","content":"Wyrd, we already did this thread! And you were there!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/898221-2e-insert-nameless-orders-here\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/898221-2e-insert-nameless-orders-here\"> [2E] Insert Nameless Orders Here - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/898221-2e-insert-nameless-orders-here\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/898221-2e-insert-nameless-orders-here </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This one is pretty straightf